  "definitions": {
    "closing_birds": "Recorded end-of-day birds for a flock on a date. Not reconstructed unless explicitly supported by verified logic.",
    "mortality_birds": "Sum of recorded mortality_birds; exclude culls unless user explicitly requests losses (mortality+culls).",
    "mortality_pct": "Definition requires review: current V3 uses deaths / opening bird-days, a daily exposure rate; a cumulative period loss percent may instead use start-of-period flock population. Do not label these interchangeably.",
